%[text] %[text:anchor:H_0AAABA39] ## Local Helper Functions
%[text] If you wish to see the details of the code, select the **View** tab and switch to **Output Inline**. Alternately, select **Output inline** using the icon ![live script output inline icon](text:image:5726) at the top right of the Live Editor pane.
